{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47296","headline":"览古十四首 九 · 吴筠","name":"览古十四首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晁错抱远策，爲君纳良规。\n削彼诸侯权，永用得所宜。\n奸臣负旧隙，乘衅谋相危。\n世主竟不辨，身戮宗且夷。\n汉景称钦明，滥罚犹如斯。\n比干与龙逢，残害何足悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47296.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47296","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}